// The stock rules plus one option, ructrl:latin: the Latin letter under Ctrl on the Russian layout.
// It lays symbols/ructrl over group 2, so ru has to be the second input source (us, ru).
! include %S/evdev

! option = types
  ructrl:latin = +ructrl

! option = symbols
  ructrl:latin = +ructrl(latin):2
